Apply SciPy's natural-order Sylvester H8 matrix to eight signed 16-bit samples. Exact signed 19-bit results, no normalization or rounding. Matrix construction is the source basis; packed vector transformation, ready/valid and reset are BEHAVE additions, not the original Python API.

